        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-E5, St. Charles Rose Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe St. Charles Towel Bar features the fleur-de-lis along the outer edge, making it a must have for those who want to add a royal elegance to their home. This bathroom towel bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inches. Choose from either medium bronze and oil rubbed bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/st-charles-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-e5\"><b>Fusion TR-E5 St. Charles Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/st-charles-toilet-tissue-holder-fusion-ph-e5\"><b>Fusion PH-E5 St. Charles Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/st-charles-robe-hook-fusion-rh-e5\"><b>Fusion RH-E5 St. Charles Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-E5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-E5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-E5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
